grid 60x24 cursor none
|      }
|    ```
|
|    Section 8: rendering pipeline notes
|
|    The renderer walks the tree once per frame and only
|    repaints rows whose content changed since the last
|    frame. This paragraph is long enough to wrap at ordinary
|    widths, with inline code, emphasis, and a link
|    (https://example.com/8) to exercise the inline painter.
|
|    • first point about caches and identity
|    • second point about width ladders
|    • third point, with a nested list:
|        • nested one
|        • nested two
